on the protection against serious accidents related to dangerous substances', 'The 2011 Hungarian Government decree aims to protect against serious accidents related to dangerous substances by regulating plants dealing with hazardous substances and those below the threshold value. The policy covers licensing, supervision activities, risk identification, safety management, public information, and protection planning. It mandates detailed rules for plant identification and risk analysis. The decree focuses on preventing accidents, limiting their impact on people and the environment, and ensuring a high level of protection. It applies to companies operating hazardous plants in Hungary.', 'The 2011 Hungarian Government decree aims to protect against serious accidents related to dangerous substances by regulating plants dealing with hazardous substances and those below the threshold value. The policy covers licensing, supervision activities, risk identification, safety management, public information, and protection planning. It mandates detailed rules for plant identification and risk analysis. The decree focuses on preventing accidents, limiting their impact on people and the environment, and ensuring a high level of protection. It applies to companies operating hazardous plants in Hungary.', 'The 2011 Hungarian Government decree aims to protect against serious accidents related to dangerous substances by regulating plants dealing with hazardous substances and those below the threshold value. The policy covers licensing, supervision activities, risk identification, safety management, public information, and protection planning. It mandates detailed rules for plant identification and risk analysis. The decree focuses on preventing accidents, limiting their impact on people and the environment, and ensuring a high level of protection. It applies to companies operating hazardous plants in Hungary.', 'Hungary', 'climate', 'in_force', '2011-01-01'::date, 'Hungary', 'https://