on the environmental impact assessment and the unified environmental use licensing procedure', 'The 2005 Hungarian Government decree focuses on the environmental impact assessment and unified environmental use licensing procedure, outlining provisions for activities and facilities specified in annexes, requirements for starting activities based on different annex listings, joint environmental impact assessment and licensing procedures, conditions for interventions in waters, roles of environmental protection authorities, and obligations for operators to report deviations and take necessary measures. The decree emphasizes public involvement, defines key terms, and mandates the use of electronic forms for official procedures.', 'The 2005 Hungarian Government decree focuses on the environmental impact assessment and unified environmental use licensing procedure, outlining provisions for activities and facilities specified in annexes, requirements for starting activities based on different annex listings, joint environmental impact assessment and licensing procedures, conditions for interventions in waters, roles of environmental protection authorities, and obligations for operators to report deviations and take necessary measures. The decree emphasizes public involvement, defines key terms, and mandates the use of electronic forms for official procedures.', 'The 2005 Hungarian Government decree focuses on the environmental impact assessment and unified environmental use licensing procedure, outlining provisions for activities and facilities specified in annexes, requirements for starting activities based on different annex listings, joint environmental impact assessment and licensing procedures, conditions for interventions in waters, roles of environmental protection authorities, and obligations for operators to report deviations and take necessary measures. The decree emphasizes public involvement, defines key terms, and mandates the use of electronic forms for official procedures.', 'Hungary', 'climate', 'in_force', '2005-01-01'::date, 'Hungary', 'https://www.carrotsandsticks.org/policies/76_10', ARRAY['regulations', 'mandatory', 'sdg6', 'hungary', 'disclosure']::text[]) ON CONFLICT (id) DO NOTHING;
